Psion Fishtank Calculator V1.0 - FREEWARE
By Peter Briggs
September 1996


A simple progam to calculate the water volume, water weight & the maximum length of fish that you should have in your tank according to the type of tank, along with the approximate heating required. Works for rectangular, hexagonal & circular tanks.

Installation
---------------
Fishtank comprises of two files FISHTANK.PIC & FISHTANK.OPA

Create the directory ..app\fishtank\

Copy fishtank.pic to ..\app\fishtank\ directory

Copy fishtank.opa to ..\app\ directory

